<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank to raise capital to 50 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Metrobank to raise capital to 50 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co (Metrobank) will raise its authorised capital stock to 50 billion pesos from 36 billion pesos, a company statement to the Philippine Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The capital hike needs the approval of shareholders, the statement issued on Thursday said. The annual stockholders meeting is scheduled on April 24.</p>
<p>The company also proposed a 20 percent stock dividend but the record date has not yet been set, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
